        <headline>Storm Warning issued September 25 at 5:46AM EDT until September 26 at 6:00PM EDT by NWS Mount Holly NJ</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 35 to 45 kt with gusts up to 55 kt and seas
16 to 21 ft expected.

* WHERE...Waters from Cape May NJ to Fenwick Island DE from 20
to 60 NM.

* WHEN...Until 6 PM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Storm force winds and hazardous seas will capsize or
damage vessels and reduce visibility.
</description>
        <instruction>Mariners should remain in port, alter course, and/or secure the
vessel for severe conditions.</instruction>
